@startuml data-flow-emulator
title Emulator Mode
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 90
skinparam ranksep 50
left to right direction

rectangle "**UI**\nCompose screens" as UI #LightBlue
rectangle "**Presentation**\nViewModels" as PRES #LightYellow
rectangle "**Engine**\nTouchTurnEngine" as ENG #LightGreen
rectangle "**Data**\nRepositories → JSON" as DATA #Wheat
rectangle "**Broker**\nEmulator" as BRK #Pink

UI --> PRES
PRES --> ENG
ENG --> BRK
ENG -[hidden]down- DATA
DATA -[hidden]up- ENG
ENG --> DATA

note bottom
  **Data flows**
  • UI ↔ Presentation: user actions, screen state
  • Presentation ↔ Engine: start/stop session, pipeline UI
  • Presentation ← Broker: positions blotter
  • Engine ↔ Data: deployments & settings
  • Engine ↔ Broker: quotes, bars, orders, fills

  **Emulator only** — synthetic prices, paper execution. No IB Gateway.
end note

@enduml
